  "aboutTitle": "About DriveBond",
  "aboutSettingsBody": "What's special about the app, which permissions you allowed and why they're needed",
  "aboutHero": "The dead time of the day — driving, in traffic or walking — becomes a good talk with someone who matters to you.",
  "aboutSpecialTitle": "What's special here",
  "aboutSpecial1Title": "A dead moment becomes a talk",
  "aboutSpecial1Body": "When you both have time at the same moment, the app connects you. No planning ahead and no \"let's talk sometime\".",
  "aboutSpecial2Title": "A call only when you both want it",
  "aboutSpecial2Body": "No call starts without a \"yes\" from both sides. Even when a trip is detected, it only means there's time, not that someone will call.",
  "aboutSpecial3Title": "While driving: by voice, with big buttons",
  "aboutSpecial3Body": "The phone reads out who's free, and you answer \"yes\" or \"no\" by voice. No typing and no lists to scroll.",
  "aboutSpecial4Title": "You're in control",
  "aboutSpecial4Body": "Who sees that you have time, quiet hours and days, hiding during calls, and blocking. All in settings.",
  "aboutSpecial5Title": "No feed and no strangers",
  "aboutSpecial5Body": "No infinite scroll and no random chat. Only talks with people you chose.",
  "aboutPermsTitle": "Phone permissions",
  "aboutPermsIntro": "What you allowed and why it's needed. Each permission is used only for what's written here.",
  "aboutPermOn": "Allowed",
  "aboutPermOff": "Not allowed",
  "aboutPermOptional": "Optional",
  "aboutPermInUse": "In use",
  "aboutPermNotifBody": "So you know when a friend is free, when someone asks if you have time, or when someone tried to reach you, even when the app is closed.",
  "aboutPermCallBody": "When you both say \"yes\", the call goes out right away through the phone's regular dialer, with no extra tap. The app doesn't read the call log.",
  "aboutPermMicBody": "Only when the app asks and waits for \"yes\" or \"no\" while driving. When the phone is connected to the car's hands-free, the car's microphone is used (music may pause for a second). Listening happens on the phone itself, and nothing is recorded or stored.",
  "aboutPermBgBody": "The phone's battery saving may stop the app in the middle of a drive. The exemption lets it keep working and notify you in time.\nThe app works in the background only during a trip, or when you marked you have time — not all day. The rest of the time it's off, and Android wakes it only when the phone is in a vehicle.\nBattery use is very small: no GPS, just a short check with the server, usually once every half minute.",
  "aboutPermContactsTitle": "Contacts",
  "aboutPermContactsBody": "To find friends who already use DriveBond. Only phone numbers are read, and they are one-way encrypted on the phone itself. Names never leave the phone, and nobody connects to you unless you choose.",
  "aboutPermActivityTitle": "Physical activity (trip detection)",
  "aboutPermActivityBody": "Only if \"Automatic availability while driving\" is on (it's on at sign-up, and you can turn it off any time). Android tells the app \"the phone is probably in a vehicle\", with no GPS and no location.",
  "aboutPermBtTitle": "Bluetooth (the car)",
  "aboutPermBtBody": "Optional: if you chose your car, the app notices when the phone connects to it, and so detects a trip faster. This stays on the phone.",
  "aboutPrivacyTitle": "What we never do",
  "aboutNever1": "We don't record calls, don't transcribe, and there's no AI on anything said.",
  "aboutNever2": "We don't read the call log.",
  "aboutNever3": "We don't use GPS. Location, route and speed are never sent to anyone.",
  "aboutNever4": "Friends see only whether you have time, in what mode (e.g. driving), and until when.",
  "aboutNever5": "We never say you're the driver, only that \"the phone is probably in a vehicle\".",
  "aboutFeedbackTitle": "Help us improve",
  "aboutFeedbackBody": "The app is still in testing. Every note helps: what you liked, what confused you, and what didn't work.",
  "meInRow": "Me",
